<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA - SECURITY COMMISSION REGISTRATIONS.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA - SECURITY COMMISSION REGISTRATIONS.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Lithuanian securities</p>
<p>commission said on Monday that it had registered ten new share</p>
<p>issues at its board meeting on Friday.</p>
<p>The commission said in a statement that it registered share</p>
<p>capital boosts from additional contributions for the following</p>
<p>companies:</p>
<p>ORS abreviation stands for ordinary shares.</p>
<p>			     Number    Face Value Share capital after</p>
<p>					   in LTL     in LTL</p>
<p>    - Tauras Bank ORS  4,000,000  10	   76,000,000</p>
<p>    - Litoda ORS	 634,901    9	    20,000,007</p>
<p>- Dvarchioniu</p>
<p>	Keramika ORS     666,138    5	    33,330,690</p>
<p>    - Versme ORS	 3,610,132  1	    11,893,807</p>
<p>The securities comission also said that it had registered</p>
<p>the share capital boost from the reserves of the following</p>
<p>companies:</p>
<p>- Endokrininiai</p>
<p>	Preparatai ORS   361,946    10	   17,900,960</p>
<p>    - Preventa ORS     10,080     100	  2,076,000</p>
<p>    - Concern SBA ORS  950,000    10	   28,500,000</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom, +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
